 454:CANopen/301/CO_PDO.c **** /*
 455:CANopen/301/CO_PDO.c ****  * Read received message from CAN module.
 456:CANopen/301/CO_PDO.c ****  *
 457:CANopen/301/CO_PDO.c ****  * Function will be called (by CAN receive interrupt) every time, when CAN message with correct ide
 458:CANopen/301/CO_PDO.c ****  * will be received. For more information and description of parameters see file CO_driver.h.
 459:CANopen/301/CO_PDO.c ****  * If new message arrives and previous message wasn't processed yet, then
 460:CANopen/301/CO_PDO.c ****  * previous message will be lost and overwritten by the new message.
